// Test: bugfixes/bare_console_log_is_not_a_builtin
// Semantic: SEM007 — `console_log(...)` is not in the standard library; the spec form is print
// Fixed in: compiler 0.33.190
// Expected output:
// Expected error:
//   SEM007
//   Function 'console_log' not found
//
// Regression (#51): the resolver registered a bare `console_log` built-in that no
// code generator implements. It passed type checking and then failed with an
// internal "not found in function map" error without an error code (or, for
// `toString`, compiled to an identity function that printed an empty string).

start:
	console_log("a")
